  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-05-01T14:32:25.824Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I was looking at my log file and found that there are a bunch of log messages about vote-kicks with \"{{targetDisplayName}}\" as the name.\n\nIt seems to have started after I made a successful vote-kick on a disruptive user.\n\n```\n\n2024.05.01 13:05:48 Log        -  [ModerationManager] A vote to kick CENSORED has been requested\n\n2024.05.01 13:06:04 Log        -  [ModerationManager] Vote to kick {{targetDisplayName}} succeeded\n\n2024.05.01 15:11:13 Log        -  [ModerationManager] A vote kick has been initiated against {{targetDisplayName}}, do you agree?\n\n```",
